SOC Detection Lab
=================

Detection-as-code content for the plaquia-labs SOC lab.

Detections included:
  * Kerberoasting - RC4 Service Ticket Requested   (T1558.003)
  * Password Spray - Single Source Many Accounts   (T1110.003)

Do not edit rules in the Splunk UI. Content is deployed from Git via
'make deploy' and any UI edits will be overwritten on the next deploy.

Source: https://github.com/archietech23/soc-detection-lab
